sequenceDiagram
    actor M04 as M04 (เพื่อนกันตลอดไป)
    participant RC as RequestController
    participant Store as Store (Service)
    participant RCR as RoleChangeRequest C01
    participant M02 as Member M02
    participant View as request_detail.html

    M04->>RC: POST /requests/C01/vote (result=APPROVE)
    RC->>Store: submit_vote("M04", "C01", APPROVE)

    note over Store: (1) ตรวจสิทธิ์ M04
    Store->>Store: get_member("M04") → active=True
    Store->>RCR: check_voter_eligible("M04")
    RCR-->>Store: ok=True (ไม่ใช่ requester/target, ยังไม่เคยลง, PENDING)

    note over RCR: (2) บันทึก Decision
    Store->>RCR: add_decision(Decision(C01,M04,APPROVE), M02)
    RCR->>RCR: decisions.append(Decision)

    note over RCR: (3) นับ approve_count
    RCR->>RCR: approve_count = 2 (M03+M04)

    note over RCR: (4) ครบ 2 เสียง → APPROVED
    RCR->>RCR: status = APPROVED

    note over M02: (5) เปลี่ยน role M02 FINANCE→EDITOR
    RCR->>M02: role = Role.EDITOR
    RCR-->>Store: (True, "ครบ 2 เสียง APPROVE → อนุมัติ...")
    Store-->>RC: (True, msg)

    RC->>RC: flash(msg, "success")
    RC->>View: redirect → request_detail C01
    View-->>M04: แสดงสถานะ APPROVED, M02 role=EDITOR
